@startuml
!include style.puml
hide circle
title Record Values - Conceptual Types Encoded Inside JSON
class Record {
  +kind : String
  +values : JSON
  +form_version : String
}
class BaselineValues <<dataType>> {
  +age : Integer {0..125}
  +gender : Integer {0=female, 1=male}
  +height : Real {100..270 cm}
  +weight : Real {20..350 kg}
  +smoking : Integer {0=no, 1=yes}
  +drinking : Integer {0=no, 1=yes}
}
class BloodPressureValues <<dataType>> {
  +systolic_bp : Real {40..300 mmHg}
  +diastolic_bp : Real {30..200 mmHg}
  +hbp_family : Integer {0=no, 1=yes}
}
class MoodValues <<dataType>> {
  +depre_question_1..9 : Integer {each 0..3}
  +/total : Integer {0..27}
}
class SleepValues <<dataType>> {
  +psqi_question_1..7 : Integer {each 0..3}
  +/total : Integer {0..21}
}
class Field {
  +key : String
  +en : String
  +zh : String
  +lo : Real = 0
  +hi : Real = 3
  +step : String = "1"
  +choices : Tuple = ()
}
Record ..> BaselineValues : kind=baseline
Record ..> BloodPressureValues : kind=hbp
Record ..> MoodValues : kind=depre
Record ..> SleepValues : kind=psqi
Field ..> Record : catalog drives validation / display
note bottom of BaselineValues
  Submission constraint: 11 <= weight/(height/100)^2 <= 75.
  Every numeric input must be finite and within field bounds.
  step="1" requires integral values; step="any" permits decimals.
end note
note bottom of BloodPressureValues
  Submission constraint: systolic_bp > diastolic_bp.
  Record date must not be later than the local current date.
end note
note bottom of MoodValues
  Q1 low mood; Q2 loss of interest; Q3 low energy;
  Q4 sleep difficulty; Q5 appetite; Q6 self-worth;
  Q7 concentration; Q8 physical discomfort; Q9 self-harm thoughts.
  Bands: 0-4 low; 5-9 moderate; 10-27 high.
  Latest Q9 > 0 produces a separate follow-up message.
end note
note bottom of SleepValues
  source: waking at night, early waking, medication,
  daytime sleepiness, dissatisfaction, daytime impact, mood impact.
  legacy: a different seven-item wording set, same JSON keys.
  record_fields() chooses labels using form_version.
  Training rejects mixed sleep versions (except hbp).
end note
note bottom of Field
  Frozen Python dataclass, not an ORM entity.
  The four value types are documentation abstractions:
  no corresponding Python classes or separate database tables.
  "/total" denotes a calculated value, not a stored JSON key.
end note
@enduml
